<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: wastedeer -->
  <VAEWaste_Wastedeer.label>荒地鹿</VAEWaste_Wastedeer.label>
  <!-- EN: The Wastedeer is a unique creature adapted to thrive in the most polluted of environments. With two heads, it is capable of detecting and avoiding danger from all directions. Its mutated form has allowed it to survive in even the harshest of conditions, making it a symbol of resilience in a world ravaged by toxins. Despite its unusual appearance, the wastedeer is a graceful and nimble creature, easily navigating the treacherous terrain of the wasteland. Though it may not pose a direct threat, its presence serves as a reminder of the dangers of a world overrun by pollution. -->
  <VAEWaste_Wastedeer.description>已對污染和毒素產生抗性的突變生物。荒地鹿身手矯健，能借助兩顆頭來快速感知周圍環境中的危險，即使在污染最嚴重的地區裡也能頑強生存、自由穿行。它們不僅被視為飽受污染侵蝕的世界再次煥發生機的象徵，同時也是對那些已有污染跡象的世界的一種警示。\n\n荒地鹿的肉有毒，請三思而後食。</VAEWaste_Wastedeer.description>
  <!-- EN: left hoof -->
  <VAEWaste_Wastedeer.tools.left_hoof.label>左蹄</VAEWaste_Wastedeer.tools.left_hoof.label>
